          "title": "How Northwind halved onboarding time with ten customer calls",
          "readTime": "8 min read",
          "link": {
            "type": "url",
            "url": "#",
            "newTab": false
          }
        },
        {
          "category": "Interviewing",
          "title": "Silence is your best follow-up question",
